/T (Provider as the single source of truth TransactionProvider extends ChangeNotifier. Each CRUD method mutates the list, saves to storage, then calls notifyListeners\(\) so every watching widget rebuilds automatically. Cloud persistence Each transaction is a document in Cloud Firestore. A realtime snapshot listener streams changes back, so the UI updates instantly across devices.)
